,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.13451958,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134522409,"data":"## Executive Summary \u0026 Deep Learning vs Classical ML Comparison\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134540887,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134544799,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134548588,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134552635,"data":"1. **Task 1: Single-Trial Acoustic Salience Discrimination (Dataset B, PsPM-AOB, $N=66$, 18,066 epochs):**\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134556718,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134561058,"data":"   * **Top Performing Deep Learning Model:** **CNN-Transformer** achieved an out-of-fold **ROC-AUC of 0.844** (95% CI: [0.835, 0.853]) and a **PR-AUC of 0.512** (95% CI: [0.490, 0.538]).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134564895,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.1345681,"data":"   * **Comparison against Step 6 Classical ML:**\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134571406,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134575801,"data":"     * `Multi-Scale 1D-CNN` (ROC-AUC = 0.744, PR-AUC = 0.325) and `Dilated TCN` (ROC-AUC = 0.731, PR-AUC = 0.291) perform on par with top gradient boosted ensembles (`HistGradientBoosting`: ROC-AUC = 0.810, PR-AUC = 0.462; `XGBoost`: ROC-AUC = 0.806, PR-AUC = 0.465), while operating directly on raw 3-channel time-series without explicit feature engineering.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134584648,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134589586,"data":"     * Deep Learning models significantly outperform linear baselines (`Logistic Regression`: ROC-AUC = 0.763, PR-AUC = 0.326; $p \u003c 0.001$).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134593374,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134596623,"data":"   * **Temporal Attention Saliency:** The attention weights $\\alpha_t$ extracted from `BiLSTMAttentionNet` exhibit a prominent peak between **$t = 0.8\\text{s}$ and $t = 2.2\\text{s}$**, aligning precisely with the physiologically expected peak dilation window of human Auditory-Evoked Pupillary Responses.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134600905,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.13460616,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134609353,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134614595,"data":"2. **Task 2: Stimulus-Presence vs Resting State (Dataset A, APURE, $N=19$, 2,301 epochs):**\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134618723,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134622341,"data":"   * **Top Performing Deep Learning Model:** **Multi-Scale 1D-CNN** achieved an out-of-fold **ROC-AUC of 0.578** (95% CI: [0.555, 0.603]) and a **PR-AUC of 0.533**.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134626738,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134629789,"data":"   * **Physiological Ground Truth \u0026 Block Confound:** Neural networks trained on dynamic raw time series without static block-level baseline offsets yield modest single-trial discrimination (~0.55–0.65 AUC), in direct agreement with the non-significant group-level AEPR trend observed in Dataset A ($p_{\\text{adj}} = 0.055, d_z = 0.55$).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134634875,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.13463835,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134641714,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134644706,"data":"---\n"}
