,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134684315,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134688026,"data":"* **Cohort:** 66 healthy participants, 18,066 trial epochs at 50 Hz ($T = 201$ timepoints).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.13469184,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134695437,"data":"* **Multi-Channel Input Tensor ($C=3$):** Subtractive dilation $\\Delta P(t)$, Divisive signal $\\%\\Delta P(t)$, Instantaneous velocity $\\frac{d\\Delta P}{dt}$.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134699986,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":26551.134703472,"data":"* **Validation:** Stratified Group 5-Fold Cross-Validation grouped strictly by `subject_id`.\n"}
